<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>가입여부 확인</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="member-container">

    <div class="step-box">

    <span class="step-current">
        ① 가입여부확인
    </span>

        →

        <span class="step-wait">
        ② 약관동의
    </span>

        →

        <span class="step-wait">
        ③ 회원정보입력
    </span>

        →

        <span class="step-wait">
        ④ 가입완료
    </span>

    </div>

    <h2 class="member-title">
        가입여부 확인
    </h2>

    <p style="text-align:center; font-size:18px;">
        이미 회원이신가요?
    </p>

    <br>

    <div style="text-align:center;">

        <a href="/user/login"
           class="member-btn"
           style="text-decoration:none;">
            로그인
        </a>

        &nbsp;&nbsp;

        <a href="/user/agree"
           class="member-btn"
           style="text-decoration:none;">
            회원가입
        </a>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>